    <div class="container">
        <h1>RealEstateCRM Support</h1>
        <p>Welcome to the support page for <strong>RealEstateCRM</strong>.</p>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Contact Support</h2>
            <p>If you need help, please email us:</p>
            <p class="email">support@yourdomain.com</p>
            <p>We typically respond within 1–2 business days.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Common Issues</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Data not saving:</strong> Try restarting the app.</li>
                <li><strong>App performance issues:</strong> Ensure your device is updated to the latest iOS version.</li>
                <li><strong>Missing data:</strong> Check if filters or search are applied.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Feedback & Feature Requests</h2>
            <p>We welcome your feedback to improve the app.</p>
            <p>
